# Arwen, Mortal Queen enters with an indestructible counter (CR 122.1b), so Bot2's Lightning Bolt on turn 2 leaves her
# on the battlefield with 3 damage marked. On turn 3 Bot1 removes that counter to pay for her ability, targeting the
# Mother of Runes cast that turn: the Mother gains indestructible until end of turn and gets a +1/+1 counter and a
# lifelink counter, and so does Arwen. Bot2 holds its second Bolt until the ability has resolved, and the Mother
# survives it. Arwen, no longer indestructible but now lifelinked, attacks for 3: Bot1 gains 3.

